WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.640
All right, let's get to some of your questions&nbsp;
for the week one that I got a bunch of times,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:11.680
including during live calls on what day was that?&nbsp;
Live calls on Tuesday was is Donald Trump really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.960
going to run again in twenty, twenty four?
There have already been rumors swirling that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:19.360
Donald Trump supposedly is telling advisers&nbsp;
he's going to run in 2024. First of all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:24.640
we should sort of be skeptical of that, because if&nbsp;
Donald Trump still exists in the state of denial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:31.120
in which he seems to be living, I don't know that&nbsp;
he still is really believing that it's over. Only&nbsp;&nbsp;

