Trump's going to a lot's going to happen to Trump&nbsp;
and who knows what he will be doing from four&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.360
years from now? I don't find it particularly&nbsp;
likely. Secondly, we really can't control that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:17.600
right now. There's nothing we can do about that&nbsp;
right now. And so I when the callers ask me this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:24.160
I will speculate today. But I am going to go&nbsp;
back to what I was saying. You know, in 2017,&nbsp;&nbsp;

